  "title": "· New Bags | CELINE Unveils Winter 2026 Collection: Le 17 Accordion Bag & Halfmoon Bag ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | CELINE 上架2026冬季系列新包：Le 17 风琴包，Halfmoon 月牙包",
  "excerpt": "CELINE's Winter 2026 bags fuse 1970s rebellion with French elegance, featuring sculptural silhouettes, the Triomphe clasp, and bold colors.",
