    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The latest CELINE Winter 2026 runway bags have just landed online, blending French elegance with the free-spirited rebellion of the 1970s. The collection features clean, sculptural silhouettes punctuated by the iconic Triomphe clasp, with a rich interplay of materials—glossy calfskin, supple nappa lambskin, and precious python. Classic shades of black, white, and chestnut set a refined tone, while saturated hues like chili red and iris purple inject a bold, painterly energy into the minimalist forms.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
