    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new 17 bag boasts a sculptural trapezoid silhouette with a five-layer bellows structure that, from the side, resembles the pages of an open book—distinctly architectural yet imbued with a vintage, literary charm. Crafted from calfskin with a lambskin lining, the bag’s signature Triomphe clasp is reimagined as a half-moon twist lock that opens with a simple turn. Inside, four separate compartments and a central zippered pocket keep belongings neatly organized, while the sliding shoulder strap allows for hand, shoulder, or crossbody wear. Offered in glossy calfskin or crossgrain leather, with black and chestnut for timeless versatility, white for cool elegance, and chili red to add a pop of brightness to autumn wardrobes.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
