    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 16 Side-to-Side bag reinterprets the classic 16 with a horizontal orientation, retaining signature elements like the architectural silhouette, T-shaped flap, half-moon metal twist lock, and arched handle. Named after the brand’s Paris headquarters at 16 Rue Vivienne, the bag is crafted from glossy calfskin with a lambskin lining. Its elongated 28 x 13 x 9 cm proportions lend a laid-back, relaxed vibe, and the detachable strap allows for shoulder or crossbody styling. Available in black, chestnut, and chili red.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
