    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Halfmoon small bag welcomes new iris purple and ink blue iterations, its soft, fine lambskin shaping a vintage crescent silhouette, with a gold Triomphe emblem as a refined focal point. These deep, saturated tones lend an artistic air. This season also introduces a camel suede version with black calfskin trim, along with black and pecan python options whose glossy, scaled texture exudes a wild, untamed spirit. The Halfmoon large bag, meanwhile, is rendered in syrah grape, its oversized frame projecting a confident, effortless attitude.",
