    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Frame series is defined by its metal framework, a nod to vintage kiss-lock bags. This season introduces three silhouettes—the Cube mini bag, the Vanity cosmetic case, and the Circle round bag—each pairing sculptural metal frames with supple leather for a striking contrast of hard and soft. The Cube and Vanity are crafted from soft lambskin and feature an interior mirror, with contrasting linings that add a delightful surprise when opened. The Circle bag is rendered in calfskin with a lambskin lining, and its long strap allows for hand or shoulder wear; its rounded form is compact yet playfully charming.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
